<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-bs-theme="dark">

<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', {
    title: 'Privacy Policy - Countic',
    description: 'What Countic collects, what it never collects, and how to delete your data.',
    canonicalPath: '/privacy',
  }); %>
</head>

<body id="top" class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

  <%- include('partials/header', { active: '' }); %>

  <main class="container my-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-center mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-center text-white-50 mb-4">Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <p class="lead">Countic is an independent tool that is not affiliated with YouTube, Google, Twitch or Kick. It
        reads only publicly available platform statistics.</p>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>What We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Server settings:</strong> which channels Countic should track and how your counters are named
            and formatted. Stored per Discord server.</li>
          <li><strong>Discord account data on login:</strong> when you sign in to the web dashboard, Countic receives
            your Discord ID, username, avatar and the list of servers you share with Countic through Discord's
            official login. This is used only to show your servers and authorize changes.</li>
          <li><strong>Operational logs:</strong> command usage is stored for 90 days (command, server, user, whether
            it succeeded) to diagnose failures and detect abuse. This covers slash commands and dashboard changes.</li>
          <li><strong>Session cookie:</strong> a login cookie so the dashboard remembers you. It contains no personal
            data beyond an opaque session identifier.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>What We Never Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Messages.</strong> Countic cannot read messages in your server, its Discord intents do not
            include them. Nothing you type is ever seen or stored.</li>
          <li><strong>Page tracking.</strong> The website runs no advertising trackers. Page views are counted
            anonymously through Cloudflare Web Analytics, which uses no cookies and receives no personal data.</li>
          <li><strong>Sold data.</strong> Nothing collected is sold or shared with advertisers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>Third Parties</h2>
        <p>Countic relies on Discord (login and bot hosting), Cloudflare (website traffic and anonymous page
          counts), its hosting provider, and the public statistics APIs of YouTube, Twitch and Kick. One exception:
          Kick's official API does not provide follower counts, so those come from a public third-party statistics
          service. All statistics requests query public channel data only.</p>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
        <p>Panel settings are deleted when you remove the panel with <code>/panel delete</code> or remove the bot from
          your server. Leftover rows are purged automatically within 7 days. Command logs expire after 90 days. To
          have your dashboard account data removed, contact us on the support server.</p>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Countic does not knowingly collect information from anyone under the age of 13. If you believe a child has
          provided personal information, contact us and it will be removed.</p>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>Changes are posted on this page with an updated date above.</p>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section class="my-4">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Join the
          <a href="https://discord.gg/kKRnpfR" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-decoration-none fw-bold text-primary-emphasis border-bottom">Countic Support Server</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer'); %>
</body>

</html>
